-code builds, redesigns, or product UI work to clarify missing product information and play back the brief before proceeding.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/get-context", "title": "Get Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/get-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76", "plugin_name": "product-design", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6ab53765b77c8191b08bdc8611976edc", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6ab5377185cc8191bbb99231ba0cb95d", "skill_name": "get-context", "contents": [], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Initialize, inspect, save, update, forget, export, or explicitly reset the Investment Banking plugin's local user context, source setup, or optional automation setup. Use only when the user explicitly asks to manage Investment Banking saved preferences, source pointers, context storage, or recurring automation.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1/user-context", "title": "Investment Banking User Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1/user-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_68c39ea2b3888191827c933053f3a1d1", "plugin_name": "investment-banking", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6a9762f9fe308191b4fed932e04e5430", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6a9762fb83d08191a0f0418350cc3ec5", "skill_name": "user-context", "contents": ["plugin-author-config", "references", "scripts", "tests"], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Load or manage Product Design's saved user context. Use when the user asks to set up Product Design, get started, onboard, save product or design sources, see what Product Design remembers, update saved context, or remember Product Design preferences. Examples include product URLs, Figma files, screenshots, reference images, codebase paths, Storybook, tokens, design systems, brand assets, and general product/design notes.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/user-context", "title": "User Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76/user-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_fa77aec24fc08191bc6e57f377126d76", "plugin_name": "product-design", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6ab53765b77c8191b08bdc8611976edc", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6ab5377185e88191a12d83ea8ce46863", "skill_name": "user-context", "contents": ["plugin-author-config", "references", "scripts"], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Initialize, inspect, save, update, forget, export, or explicitly reset the Public Equity Investing plugin's local user context, source setup, or optional automation setup. Use only when the user explicitly asks to manage Public Equity Investing saved preferences, source pointers, context storage, or recurring automation.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e/user-context", "title": "Public Equity Investing User Context", "uri": "skill://Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e/user-context", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e", "plugin_name": "public-equity-investing", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6a9763b1e3ac8191aa34ebef431cee1b", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6a9763b34a5481919bf5b654cc90a00d", "skill_name": "user-context", "contents": ["plugin-author-config", "references", "scripts", "tests"], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Use when sizing Public Equity Investing positions, finding equity hedges, or building an integrated position-and-hedge risk plan from a listed-equity thesis. Do not use for thesis construction, standalone event underwriting, trade execution, personal investment advice, or credit-instrument risk.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e/portfolio-ri<redacted>", "title": "Portfolio Risk Management", "uri": "skill://Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e/portfolio-ri<redacted>", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_b31b1ece54648191a6760ea4580bba3e", "plugin_name": "public-equity-investing", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6a9763b1e3ac8191aa34ebef431cee1b", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6a9763b34a48819192183b246a5a0d6a", "skill_name": "portfolio-ri<redacted>", "contents": ["references", "scripts"], "allow_implicit_invocation": false}}, {"description": "Create video compositions, animations, title cards, overlays, captions, voiceovers, audio-reactive visuals, and scene transitions in HyperFrames HTML. Use when asked to build any HTML-based video content, add captions or subtitles synced to audio, generate text-to-speech narration, create audio-reactive animation (beat sync, glow, pulse driven by music), add animated text highlighting (marker sweeps, hand-drawn circles, burst lines, scribble, sketchout), or add transitions between scenes (crossfades, wipes, reveals, shader transitions). Covers composition authoring, timing, media, and the full video production workflow. For CLI commands (init, lint, preview, render, transcribe, tts) see the hyperframes-cli skill.", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "Plugin_d72b815ecf6481919e3beede9c71ef08/hyperframes", "title": "HyperFrames", "uri": "skill://Plugin_d72b815ecf6481919e3beede9c71ef08/hyperframes", "_meta": {"plugin_id": "Plugin_d72b815ecf6481919e3beede9c71ef08", "plugin_name": "hyperframes", "plugin_release_id": "pluginrel_6a27341ef4fc819189ba9c0205b5c514", "plugin_release_skill_id": "pluginrsk_6a27342267bc81919d8864562acab312", "skill_name": "hyperframes", "contents": ["palettes", "references", "scripts"], "allow_implicit_invocation": true}}, {"description": "Use when creating new skills, editing existing skills, or verifying skills work before deployment", "mimeType": "mcp/skill", "name": "plugins~Plugin_60aea7460bd4819199fd97a9553a5e12/writing-skills", "title": "Writing Skills", "uri": "skill://plugins~Plugin_60aea7460bd4819199fd97a9553a5e12/writing-skills", "_meta": {